# 这些文件是给 Linux 消费的，必须是 LF。
#
# core.autocrlf=true 会在检出时把它们转成 CRLF，而 CRLF 的 shell 脚本在 Linux 上
# 直接报 "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M"。push.sh 打包的正是工作区里的
# bootstrap.sh，所以这不是理论问题——不写这几行，别人 clone 之后第一次部署必炸。
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
cloud/deploy/caddy-snippet.txt text eol=lf

# Windows launchers must keep CRLF. cmd.exe can split long LF-only batch lines
# into truncated commands, especially after an automated patch rewrites them.
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.ps1           text eol=crlf
